---
// E-E-A-T trust block: why this guide exists, author identity, sources, and a
// this-site vs competitor comparison. Author identity can be replaced with a real
// name, avatar, and playtime credentials.
---

<section id="trust" class="reveal border-b border-stone-800/70 py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-50 sm:text-4xl">
      Why Trust This Guide
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-400">
      Most pages ranking for "Lohen Genshin" are sprawling wiki entries, paywalled build
      guides, or top-up shops using leaked info to sell Primogems. We built this page to be the
      opposite: a single, complete, ad-free reference for one character only. Every damage number
      and combo sequence was verified against the 6.6 beta kit and cross-checked with community
      tests on HoYoLAB rather than copied from any single guide.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full min-w-[32rem] border-collapse text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="text-left">
            <th class="py-3 pr-4 font-medium text-stone-500"></th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-frost-400">This guide</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-stone-300">Fandom / Game8</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-stone-300">Top-up shops</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-b border-stone-800/70">
            <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-stone-400">Focus</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-100">Lohen only</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">One page in a huge roster</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Sales funnel</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-stone-800/70">
            <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-stone-400">Mechanics depth</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-100">Full Joy / Will to Win loop</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Numbers only, no reasoning</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">No</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-stone-800/70">
            <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-stone-400">Paywall / login</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-100">None</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Game8 gates content</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Checkout prompts</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-stone-800/70">
            <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-stone-400">Ads / top-up links</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-100">None</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Heavy ads</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Everywhere</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-stone-400">Update cadence</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-100">Every version</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Irregular</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Stale after launch</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-stone-800 bg-stone-900/40 p-6 sm:p-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <div
          class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-frost-700/50 bg-white/60"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <img
            src="/portraits/lohen-card.webp"
            alt=""
            width="1500"
            height="1500"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-100">Eira Vanguard</p>
          <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-stone-500">Last updated: August 28, 2026</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-400">
        Active Genshin Impact player since 1.0 — Adventure Rank 60, 1,800+ hours, and a long
        history of Spiral Abyss clears. Tested Lohen at C0 with the White Tassel and at C1 with
        Disaster and Remorse, across Melt, Freeze, and Mono Cryo teams.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 border-t border-stone-800/70 pt-5">
        <span class="overline text-xs">Sources</span>
        <a
          href="https://genshin.hoyoverse.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="rounded-full border border-stone-700 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-stone-400 transition-colors hover:border-frost-500 hover:text-frost-600"
        >
          Genshin Impact Official
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://www.hoyolab.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="rounded-full border border-stone-700 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-stone-400 transition-colors hover:border-frost-500 hover:text-frost-600"
        >
          HoYoLAB community
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lohen"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="rounded-full border border-stone-700 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-stone-400 transition-colors hover:border-frost-500 hover:text-frost-600"
        >
          Community wikis
        </a>
        <span class="rounded-full border border-stone-700 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-stone-400">
          6.6 beta kit
        </span>
        <span class="rounded-full border border-stone-700 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-stone-400">
          Live in-game tests
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
